The [public Linkstash product page](https://aylith-labs.github.io/linkstash/) now explains the source-run workflow and its limits. It is a static page, **not a hosted bookmark account**. The app itself remains a trusted, single-operator prototype without built-in authentication.

## Current source-run capture

These paired light and dark images come from the **actual locally running Linkstash web app**, with fictional `.example.test` bookmarks and disposable collections. One bookmark was saved through the app form; the rest of the fictional fixture was populated through its API. The poster is an annotated study assembled from real UI pixels, not evidence of a customer library.

